1
00:00:01,130 --> 00:00:03,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>BEYOND JOURNEY'S END</b></font>

2
00:00:03,170 --> 00:00:05,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ opening theme song playing]</b></font>

3
00:01:29,840 --> 00:01:32,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>EPISODE 30:
THE HERO OF THE SOUTH</b></font>

4
00:01:32,840 --> 00:01:34,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

5
00:01:34,050 --> 00:01:35,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[birds chirping]</b></font>

6
00:01:36,390 --> 00:01:39,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OLD MAN] We have a statue
in dire need of a good polish.</b></font>

7
00:01:41,140 --> 00:01:42,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What's the reward?</b></font>

8
00:01:43,520 --> 00:01:46,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OLD MAN] A spell to scratch
the hard-to-reach,</b></font>

9
00:01:46,150 --> 00:01:48,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>itchy parts on your back.</b></font>

10
00:01:51,070 --> 00:01:52,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[OLD MAN] Hmm.</b></font>

11
00:01:52,610 --> 00:01:54,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>29 YEARS AFTER THE DEATH
OF HIMMEL THE HERO,</b></font>

12
00:01:54,570 --> 00:01:56,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IN FABEL VILLAGE, LOCATED
IN THE NORTHERN LANDS</b></font>

13
00:01:59,370 --> 00:02:01,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I guess we're back
to odd jobs, then.</b></font>

14
00:02:02,370 --> 00:02:05,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems there are rusty statues
of Mr. Himmel in every town.</b></font>

15
00:02:06,000 --> 00:02:08,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>True! It'll be nice
to use our hands</b></font>

16
00:02:08,050 --> 00:02:10,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for more than axe
and staff slinging.</b></font>

17
00:02:10,590 --> 00:02:12,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>All right. Time to clean!</b></font>

18
00:02:12,930 --> 00:02:15,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The statue's made of bronze,
so we can use magic.</b></font>

19
00:02:15,550 --> 00:02:17,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You won't have
to lift a single finger.</b></font>

20
00:02:17,640 --> 00:02:18,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Uh?</b></font>

21
00:02:22,680 --> 00:02:23,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Uh...</b></font>

22
00:02:26,650 --> 00:02:28,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] That guy isn't Himmel!</b></font>

23
00:02:29,190 --> 00:02:31,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Is this your
first time seeing him?</b></font>

24
00:02:32,440 --> 00:02:34,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's the Hero of the South.</b></font>

25
00:02:34,320 --> 00:02:35,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOTH] Hmm.</b></font>

26
00:02:35,950 --> 00:02:39,080
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though Himmel was the one
who defeated the Demon King,</b></font>

27
00:02:39,120 --> 00:02:40,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he was not the only hero.</b></font>

28
00:02:42,000 --> 00:02:45,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Dozens of brave souls
made the attempt before him.</b></font>

29
00:02:45,620 --> 00:02:46,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But of them all,</b></font>

30
00:02:47,170 --> 00:02:50,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the Hero of the South was said
to be humanity's strongest.</b></font>

31
00:02:50,670 --> 00:02:52,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
That seems a bit extreme.</b></font>

32
00:02:52,970 --> 00:02:54,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'd have to disagree.</b></font>

33
00:02:54,970 --> 00:02:57,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In my opinion,
he was worthy of the title.</b></font>

34
00:02:58,800 --> 00:03:01,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At the time, a fearsome group
posed a threat to humanity.</b></font>

35
00:03:03,060 --> 00:03:05,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Seven Sages of Destruction.</b></font>

36
00:03:05,310 --> 00:03:06,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They controlled
the major regions</b></font>

37
00:03:06,940 --> 00:03:08,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>around the northern lands.</b></font>

38
00:03:09,730 --> 00:03:11,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Despite all our
greatest efforts,</b></font>

39
00:03:11,650 --> 00:03:15,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we only managed to defeat
two members of their band.</b></font>

40
00:03:16,160 --> 00:03:18,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Of the other five, two vanished.</b></font>

41
00:03:18,240 --> 00:03:21,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We assumed they either fled
or tucked themselves away.</b></font>

42
00:03:21,200 --> 00:03:24,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Guess one of those was
Aura the Guillotine.</b></font>

43
00:03:24,290 --> 00:03:26,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] The Hero of the South
was powerful enough</b></font>

44
00:03:26,920 --> 00:03:28,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to defeat the remaining three.</b></font>

45
00:03:28,920 --> 00:03:31,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[children laughing]</b></font>

46
00:03:32,250 --> 00:03:35,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His rapid advance was
unlike anything I've ever seen.</b></font>

47
00:03:36,300 --> 00:03:38,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>In just a year,
he completely annihilated</b></font>

48
00:03:38,550 --> 00:03:40,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the Demon King's
front-line troops.</b></font>

49
00:03:41,260 --> 00:03:43,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That cleared a pathway
to the very top</b></font>

50
00:03:43,260 --> 00:03:44,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>of the Northern Plateau,</b></font>

51
00:03:45,020 --> 00:03:47,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the heart of the
Demon King's supply route.</b></font>

52
00:03:48,730 --> 00:03:49,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

53
00:03:50,310 --> 00:03:53,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's where he was defeated
by Schlacht the Omniscient,</b></font>

54
00:03:53,360 --> 00:03:54,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the Demon King's confidant</b></font>

55
00:03:54,740 --> 00:03:57,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>who could see a thousand years
into the future,</b></font>

56
00:03:57,450 --> 00:03:58,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>making him a fearsome foe.</b></font>

57
00:03:59,200 --> 00:04:01,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At the hands of Schlacht
and the Seven Sages,</b></font>

58
00:04:02,200 --> 00:04:03,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>he met his end.</b></font>

59
00:04:04,410 --> 00:04:06,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He fought against all seven?</b></font>

60
00:04:06,450 --> 00:04:08,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No wonder he kicked the bucket.</b></font>

61
00:04:09,000 --> 00:04:10,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
It wasn't a quick fight.</b></font>

62
00:04:10,830 --> 00:04:13,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He still defeated
three of them, remember?</b></font>

63
00:04:13,750 --> 00:04:16,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The battle only ended
when he and Schlacht</b></font>

64
00:04:16,340 --> 00:04:18,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>took each other's lives.</b></font>

65
00:04:22,180 --> 00:04:23,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His valiant efforts that day</b></font>

66
00:04:23,680 --> 00:04:25,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>liberated many people
in this region</b></font>

67
00:04:25,890 --> 00:04:28,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>from the tyranny
of the Seven Sages.</b></font>

68
00:04:29,230 --> 00:04:30,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It only makes sense</b></font>

69
00:04:30,350 --> 00:04:32,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the villagers here
are devoted to him.</b></font>

70
00:04:34,070 --> 00:04:35,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because the Hero
of the South's body</b></font>

71
00:04:35,940 --> 00:04:37,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>was never recovered,</b></font>

72
00:04:37,320 --> 00:04:39,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>legend claims he's
still fighting tooth and nail</b></font>

73
00:04:39,950 --> 00:04:42,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>with Schlacht the Omniscient
to this day.</b></font>

74
00:04:42,370 --> 00:04:44,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though I highly doubt
it's that romantic.</b></font>

75
00:04:46,580 --> 00:04:49,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>His opponents had a keen taste
for human flesh.</b></font>

76
00:04:49,710 --> 00:04:52,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I imagine they ate
every last piece of the hero.</b></font>

77
00:04:56,130 --> 00:04:58,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Shall we get the old boy
cleaned up?</b></font>

78
00:05:04,720 --> 00:05:06,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] I refuse.</b></font>

79
00:05:06,470 --> 00:05:08,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I cannot defeat the Demon King.</b></font>

80
00:05:09,520 --> 00:05:12,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm... I knew that
this would happen.</b></font>

81
00:05:13,440 --> 00:05:15,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And I knew I'd never
conjure up the right words</b></font>

82
00:05:15,650 --> 00:05:17,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to convince
a complete enigma like you.</b></font>

83
00:05:21,070 --> 00:05:22,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You speak
as if you already knew</b></font>

84
00:05:22,820 --> 00:05:24,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>exactly how
this would play out.</b></font>

85
00:05:25,870 --> 00:05:28,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I suppose it seems that way
because I did.</b></font>

86
00:05:29,120 --> 00:05:30,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm.</b></font>

87
00:05:32,250 --> 00:05:35,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You seem the type
to carefully guard a secret.</b></font>

88
00:05:35,630 --> 00:05:36,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Hm?</b></font>

89
00:05:37,130 --> 00:05:38,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HERO OF THE SOUTH]
I could serve</b></font>

90
00:05:38,210 --> 00:05:40,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>my most hidden
confessions to you</b></font>

91
00:05:40,170 --> 00:05:41,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>on a silver platter,</b></font>

92
00:05:41,630 --> 00:05:43,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and you would
never tell a soul.</b></font>

93
00:05:44,260 --> 00:05:47,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So I shall confide in you,
and you alone.</b></font>

94
00:05:47,510 --> 00:05:49,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's only one reason
that I have come to be</b></font>

95
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>humanity's strongest hero.</b></font>

96
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:57,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I walk in the present,
yet see the future.</b></font>

97
00:05:59,070 --> 00:06:00,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My!</b></font>

98
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:01,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's quite impressive.</b></font>

99
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hm?</b></font>

100
00:06:04,030 --> 00:06:06,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You don't believe
I'm telling the truth?</b></font>

101
00:06:06,370 --> 00:06:07,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren blows]</b></font>

102
00:06:07,620 --> 00:06:09,450
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No, I believe you.</b></font>

103
00:06:09,660 --> 00:06:12,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just can't bring myself
to care.</b></font>

104
00:06:14,540 --> 00:06:16,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Allow me
to pique your interest,</b></font>

105
00:06:16,500 --> 00:06:19,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for the near future holds
much for you and me.</b></font>

106
00:06:20,380 --> 00:06:23,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know of the Seven Sages
of Destruction, yes?</b></font>

107
00:06:24,760 --> 00:06:26,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

108
00:06:29,010 --> 00:06:31,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>One year from now,
on the Northern Plateau,</b></font>

109
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:35,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I will be slain along with
Schlacht the Omniscient.</b></font>

110
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:37,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They shall rip me
from the world</b></font>

111
00:06:37,360 --> 00:06:39,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have fought
so hard to protect.</b></font>

112
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:40,690
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

113
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:14,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Fate has decreed I'm to die
without achieving my goal.</b></font>

114
00:07:14,680 --> 00:07:15,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

115
00:07:19,980 --> 00:07:22,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't feel sorry for me.</b></font>

116
00:07:22,530 --> 00:07:25,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if you were to join me
on my journey,</b></font>

117
00:07:25,860 --> 00:07:29,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I fear the truth of my demise
is already set in stone.</b></font>

118
00:07:30,780 --> 00:07:32,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Forget me.</b></font>

119
00:07:32,580 --> 00:07:33,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Soon, a much younger,</b></font>

120
00:07:34,000 --> 00:07:36,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>sunnier hero
will pay you a visit.</b></font>

121
00:07:36,330 --> 00:07:37,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

122
00:07:37,920 --> 00:07:41,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though, it terribly pains
my soul to admit,</b></font>

123
00:07:41,540 --> 00:07:44,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it is he who will save
the world, and not I.</b></font>

124
00:07:45,260 --> 00:07:47,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He will successfully
convince you</b></font>

125
00:07:47,050 --> 00:07:48,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to travel with his party,</b></font>

126
00:07:48,890 --> 00:07:51,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and that party will defeat
the Demon King.</b></font>

127
00:07:51,550 --> 00:07:53,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I honestly
can't see that happening.</b></font>

128
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HERO OF THE SOUTH]
You'll see once you meet him.</b></font>

129
00:07:57,270 --> 00:08:00,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That young man is going to
change your life for good.</b></font>

130
00:08:00,060 --> 00:08:01,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

131
00:08:04,280 --> 00:08:07,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, then,
the clock is ticking.</b></font>

132
00:08:11,870 --> 00:08:15,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Before I go,
may I ask you a favor?</b></font>

133
00:08:15,540 --> 00:08:16,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] What is it?</b></font>

134
00:08:18,500 --> 00:08:20,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HERO OF THE SOUTH]
When you meet that young man,</b></font>

135
00:08:20,750 --> 00:08:22,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>give him this message.</b></font>

136
00:08:36,890 --> 00:08:38,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

137
00:08:38,140 --> 00:08:39,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HERO OF THE SOUTH]
You have my word.</b></font>

138
00:08:43,860 --> 00:08:46,320
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I will clear a path for you.</b></font>

139
00:08:53,660 --> 00:08:55,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Put your faith
in humanity's strongest,</b></font>

140
00:08:55,910 --> 00:08:57,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the Hero of the South.</b></font>

141
00:09:00,750 --> 00:09:03,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Even if my contributions
are buried</b></font>

142
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:04,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>in the shadows of history,</b></font>

143
00:09:04,790 --> 00:09:06,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it will be well worth it.</b></font>

144
00:09:09,470 --> 00:09:10,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark laughing]</b></font>

145
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:12,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOY 1] Hey! Get back here!</b></font>

146
00:09:12,430 --> 00:09:13,970
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[BOY 2] You'll never get away!</b></font>

147
00:09:15,760 --> 00:09:17,140
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren chuckles softly]</b></font>

148
00:09:19,430 --> 00:09:21,560
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
Some foresight you had.</b></font>

149
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:26,020
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You are as present here as ever.</b></font>

150
00:09:26,610 --> 00:09:28,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>History hasn't forgotten
a thing.</b></font>

151
00:09:30,950 --> 00:09:32,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>29 YEARS AFTER THE DEATH
OF HIMMEL THE HERO,</b></font>

152
00:09:32,860 --> 00:09:34,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>IN GRAF DACH'S DOMAIN, LOCATED
IN THE NORTHERN LANDS</b></font>

153
00:09:35,950 --> 00:09:38,910
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The last time we were in
a big city was ages ago.</b></font>

154
00:09:38,950 --> 00:09:40,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
We're leaving as soon as</b></font>

155
00:09:40,410 --> 00:09:42,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>we replenish our supplies.</b></font>

156
00:09:42,250 --> 00:09:45,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seriously? I'd be okay
with taking it slow.</b></font>

157
00:09:47,210 --> 00:09:48,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hey.</b></font>

158
00:09:49,340 --> 00:09:51,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They've even got magic shops.</b></font>

159
00:09:51,550 --> 00:09:53,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Summon your focus, Stark.</b></font>

160
00:09:53,300 --> 00:09:55,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't you know
time is a finite resource?</b></font>

161
00:09:55,470 --> 00:09:56,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Yeah, I'm well-aware.</b></font>

162
00:09:57,890 --> 00:09:59,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern grunts softly]</b></font>

163
00:09:59,600 --> 00:10:01,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

164
00:10:20,620 --> 00:10:22,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Well, that's everything.</b></font>

165
00:10:22,870 --> 00:10:23,870
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Come on.</b></font>

166
00:10:24,080 --> 00:10:25,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At least let us grab
something nice to eat</b></font>

167
00:10:25,710 --> 00:10:27,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>before we leave town.</b></font>

168
00:10:27,590 --> 00:10:28,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not a chance.</b></font>

169
00:10:28,920 --> 00:10:30,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We've no coin to spare.</b></font>

170
00:10:30,710 --> 00:10:32,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We must be economical,</b></font>

171
00:10:32,260 --> 00:10:34,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>or our pockets will be empty
when we need them full.</b></font>

172
00:10:35,090 --> 00:10:36,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You've sure turned over
a new leaf.</b></font>

173
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:38,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Quick. Let's go.</b></font>

174
00:10:39,390 --> 00:10:42,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>She's been acting strange
this whole time.</b></font>

175
00:10:44,190 --> 00:10:45,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Something's off.</b></font>

176
00:10:45,480 --> 00:10:47,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Normally, she'd want
to stay and explore</b></font>

177
00:10:47,150 --> 00:10:49,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a big city like this
for a few months or longer.</b></font>

178
00:10:50,020 --> 00:10:51,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But...</b></font>

179
00:10:51,650 --> 00:10:53,360
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We were so close.</b></font>

180
00:10:54,610 --> 00:10:57,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You must be
the illustrious Miss Frieren.</b></font>

181
00:10:57,780 --> 00:11:00,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My lord has formally invited you
to dinner at his home.</b></font>

182
00:11:01,870 --> 00:11:04,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] We're not hungry.
And we're in a hurry.</b></font>

183
00:11:06,460 --> 00:11:07,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It is truly a shame.</b></font>

184
00:11:07,960 --> 00:11:10,380
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He says Miss Frieren was
a member of the party of heroes</b></font>

185
00:11:10,420 --> 00:11:12,760
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that saved this land years ago.</b></font>

186
00:11:13,170 --> 00:11:16,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>He merely wishes to give
his thanks to all three of you.</b></font>

187
00:11:18,890 --> 00:11:20,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren sighs]</b></font>

188
00:11:21,810 --> 00:11:23,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[insects trilling]</b></font>

189
00:11:23,810 --> 00:11:26,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[knife slicing softly]</b></font>

190
00:11:28,270 --> 00:11:30,770
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Mm. Now that's what
I'm talkin' about!</b></font>

191
00:11:30,820 --> 00:11:32,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Dach chuckles]</b></font>

192
00:11:32,070 --> 00:11:34,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thank you for
the kind invitation, Graf Dach.</b></font>

193
00:11:34,820 --> 00:11:35,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Sincerely.</b></font>

194
00:11:36,530 --> 00:11:39,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] She looks
terribly unhappy.</b></font>

195
00:11:39,200 --> 00:11:41,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I should thank you.</b></font>

196
00:11:41,160 --> 00:11:44,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You helped my great grandpa.
I'm eternally grateful.</b></font>

197
00:11:45,410 --> 00:11:46,580
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So, what do you want?</b></font>

198
00:11:46,620 --> 00:11:47,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Dach chuckles]</b></font>

199
00:11:47,920 --> 00:11:50,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I admire those who can get
straight to the point.</b></font>

200
00:11:50,710 --> 00:11:53,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The truth is, my family's
treasured heirloom sword</b></font>

201
00:11:53,670 --> 00:11:56,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>has been stolen from us
by a demon.</b></font>

202
00:11:56,050 --> 00:11:58,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You allowed it
to be stolen again?</b></font>

203
00:11:58,180 --> 00:11:59,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Hmm. "Again?"</b></font>

204
00:12:00,930 --> 00:12:03,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was stolen from
his great-grandpa, too.</b></font>

205
00:12:04,520 --> 00:12:06,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They just don't live and learn.</b></font>

206
00:12:07,770 --> 00:12:09,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Very well.</b></font>

207
00:12:10,480 --> 00:12:12,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You can reward me
with a grimoire.</b></font>

208
00:12:16,190 --> 00:12:18,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Seems like a fair price.</b></font>

209
00:12:20,870 --> 00:12:22,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] What a pain.</b></font>

210
00:12:22,280 --> 00:12:24,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I've found many of the nobles
in the northern lands</b></font>

211
00:12:24,740 --> 00:12:26,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to be extremely pushy.</b></font>

212
00:12:26,910 --> 00:12:28,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But I recall this family
has always made</b></font>

213
00:12:28,710 --> 00:12:31,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>particularly unreasonable
demands.</b></font>

214
00:12:33,250 --> 00:12:34,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If you don't get
my sword back,</b></font>

215
00:12:34,750 --> 00:12:36,510
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I will throw you
in the dungeon.</b></font>

216
00:12:36,550 --> 00:12:39,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[HIMMEL] Huh?
-[EISEN] Talk about tyrannical.</b></font>

217
00:12:40,720 --> 00:12:42,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>At least they were able
to point us in the direction</b></font>

218
00:12:42,850 --> 00:12:44,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>that the demon fled
this time around.</b></font>

219
00:12:44,760 --> 00:12:47,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We were given no leads before.</b></font>

220
00:12:49,440 --> 00:12:50,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The aimlessness of our search</b></font>

221
00:12:51,020 --> 00:12:53,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>conjures images
of needles and haystacks.</b></font>

222
00:12:55,280 --> 00:12:57,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Ultimately,
we did find the sword.</b></font>

223
00:12:58,110 --> 00:13:00,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It was at the top
of the Schwer Mountains.</b></font>

224
00:13:01,950 --> 00:13:03,700
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>What a waste of energy.</b></font>

225
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:05,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Huh.</b></font>

226
00:13:05,540 --> 00:13:08,160
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I wonder why the demons
have stolen the sword again.</b></font>

227
00:13:09,250 --> 00:13:11,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] The sword wasn't
the Dach Family's originally.</b></font>

228
00:13:11,870 --> 00:13:14,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It once belonged
to a famous demon.</b></font>

229
00:13:15,500 --> 00:13:18,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It must possess some appeal
only demons understand.</b></font>

230
00:13:20,090 --> 00:13:23,090
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You know, when he mentioned
this job,</b></font>

231
00:13:23,430 --> 00:13:25,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was sure
you would turn it down.</b></font>

232
00:13:25,100 --> 00:13:27,100
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren inhales
and exhales deeply]</b></font>

233
00:13:27,140 --> 00:13:28,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I didn't have a real choice.</b></font>

234
00:13:29,430 --> 00:13:32,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is the very same sword
Himmel retrieved.</b></font>

235
00:13:33,770 --> 00:13:35,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If I had let it stay stolen,</b></font>

236
00:13:35,610 --> 00:13:37,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>his efforts would've been
for naught.</b></font>

237
00:13:38,690 --> 00:13:42,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Besides, Himmel wouldn't
abandon someone in need.</b></font>

238
00:13:42,320 --> 00:13:44,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

239
00:14:31,410 --> 00:14:32,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We're too late.</b></font>

240
00:14:33,330 --> 00:14:35,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It's already been destroyed.</b></font>

241
00:14:38,210 --> 00:14:39,880
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] There's nobody left.</b></font>

242
00:14:40,840 --> 00:14:43,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-[rustling]
-[birds cawing]</b></font>

243
00:14:44,590 --> 00:14:47,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>No. I can sense one.</b></font>

244
00:14:57,770 --> 00:14:59,230
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Are you from this village?</b></font>

245
00:14:59,570 --> 00:15:00,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WOMAN] No.</b></font>

246
00:15:00,650 --> 00:15:02,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm a traveling priest.</b></font>

247
00:15:02,610 --> 00:15:03,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>And who are you?</b></font>

248
00:15:04,740 --> 00:15:06,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Just adventurers
passing through.</b></font>

249
00:15:10,280 --> 00:15:11,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Look around.</b></font>

250
00:15:12,040 --> 00:15:14,710
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This is the work
of the Sword Demon.</b></font>

251
00:15:16,420 --> 00:15:20,040
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I came here to mourn
the innocent lives they stole.</b></font>

252
00:15:21,000 --> 00:15:22,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You said "Sword Demon?"</b></font>

253
00:15:23,760 --> 00:15:26,840
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That sounds like the very demon
we came here to slay.</b></font>

254
00:15:27,590 --> 00:15:29,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WOMAN]
The sword demon has destroyed</b></font>

255
00:15:29,350 --> 00:15:31,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>countless villages
in this region.</b></font>

256
00:15:31,890 --> 00:15:34,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There has never been
a single survivor.</b></font>

257
00:15:36,020 --> 00:15:37,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] How awful.</b></font>

258
00:15:38,400 --> 00:15:40,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[WOMAN]
Brave adventurers...</b></font>

259
00:15:41,730 --> 00:15:44,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Will you offer a prayer
for their souls?</b></font>

260
00:15:51,870 --> 00:15:53,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Wait, did I miss something?</b></font>

261
00:15:54,500 --> 00:15:55,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] As I thought,</b></font>

262
00:15:55,660 --> 00:15:58,000
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>there are no bodies
buried here.</b></font>

263
00:15:58,040 --> 00:15:59,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Why not?</b></font>

264
00:16:00,460 --> 00:16:02,960
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because the traveling priest
is the Sword Demon.</b></font>

265
00:16:03,000 --> 00:16:04,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern and Stark gasp]</b></font>

266
00:16:04,130 --> 00:16:06,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Not the type to leave corpses,
are you?</b></font>

267
00:16:07,430 --> 00:16:10,180
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I was nearly starving
when I killed them.</b></font>

268
00:16:11,640 --> 00:16:14,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I did what I had to do
in order to survive.</b></font>

269
00:16:17,770 --> 00:16:20,440
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Even though
you don't have to eat humans?</b></font>

270
00:16:21,980 --> 00:16:23,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[SWORD DEMON]
Perhaps I don't have to,</b></font>

271
00:16:23,900 --> 00:16:26,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but that doesn't mean
I shouldn't.</b></font>

272
00:16:27,110 --> 00:16:29,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Speaking to it
is a waste of time.</b></font>

273
00:16:33,490 --> 00:16:34,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Destroy it.</b></font>

274
00:16:40,790 --> 00:16:42,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunting]</b></font>

275
00:16:49,010 --> 00:16:50,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] It's quick.</b></font>

276
00:16:53,180 --> 00:16:54,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Fern gasps]</b></font>

277
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:56,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark grunting]</b></font>

278
00:17:00,650 --> 00:17:01,980
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks for that.</b></font>

279
00:17:02,400 --> 00:17:04,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Don't mention it.
It's what I'm here for.</b></font>

280
00:17:27,050 --> 00:17:29,590
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[shivering] So cold.</b></font>

281
00:17:29,630 --> 00:17:31,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>This was a truly awful job.</b></font>

282
00:17:31,590 --> 00:17:34,850
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Agreed. But at least
we defeated a demon.</b></font>

283
00:17:41,900 --> 00:17:44,310
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] It was an inconvenience
at the moment.</b></font>

284
00:17:44,360 --> 00:17:46,150
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But down the road,</b></font>

285
00:17:46,190 --> 00:17:48,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>our efforts today
could save lives.</b></font>

286
00:17:48,940 --> 00:17:50,530
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

287
00:17:50,900 --> 00:17:52,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You never know.</b></font>

288
00:17:52,240 --> 00:17:55,200
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's why I can't abandon
someone who needs me.</b></font>

289
00:17:58,120 --> 00:18:01,830
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles] Or maybe your joy
merely grows with our sorrow.</b></font>

290
00:18:02,160 --> 00:18:04,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The challenge
is what makes it exciting.</b></font>

291
00:18:05,250 --> 00:18:07,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Exciting for who?</b></font>

292
00:18:11,720 --> 00:18:13,550
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Expertly done, you two.</b></font>

293
00:18:20,560 --> 00:18:22,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You fired first. Why?</b></font>

294
00:18:23,190 --> 00:18:26,270
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The demon hadn't escalated
the situation at all.</b></font>

295
00:18:26,940 --> 00:18:29,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Because I knew you and Stark
were about to pray.</b></font>

296
00:18:30,740 --> 00:18:33,280
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>-I had no choice but to act.
-[Fern exclaims softly]</b></font>

297
00:18:33,320 --> 00:18:34,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

298
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:42,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Typically,
when people go to pray,</b></font>

299
00:18:42,790 --> 00:18:44,420
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they close their eyes.</b></font>

300
00:18:45,670 --> 00:18:48,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The demon knew that
and took advantage of it</b></font>

301
00:18:48,210 --> 00:18:51,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>to kill and consume
compassionate travelers.</b></font>

302
00:18:52,210 --> 00:18:53,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark exclaims softly]</b></font>

303
00:18:58,930 --> 00:19:00,470
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

304
00:19:01,560 --> 00:19:02,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[chuckles]</b></font>

305
00:19:06,190 --> 00:19:08,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>My treasured heirloom
is home at last.</b></font>

306
00:19:08,940 --> 00:19:10,570
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm ever in your debt.</b></font>

307
00:19:10,690 --> 00:19:11,820
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Thanks to you...</b></font>

308
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:15,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>our beloved city
is safe once more.</b></font>

309
00:19:15,780 --> 00:19:16,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Frieren chuckles]</b></font>

310
00:19:18,530 --> 00:19:20,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[footsteps]</b></font>

311
00:19:21,370 --> 00:19:24,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Could you please
drop us off at the marketplace?</b></font>

312
00:19:24,750 --> 00:19:26,370
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Why certainly, ma'am.</b></font>

313
00:19:31,170 --> 00:19:32,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] At the end of the day,</b></font>

314
00:19:32,670 --> 00:19:35,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the Graf seemed
quite happy with us.</b></font>

315
00:19:35,090 --> 00:19:38,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I just hope he keeps a close eye
on his sword.</b></font>

316
00:19:38,680 --> 00:19:41,720
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I have a feeling that
if the demons want it so badly,</b></font>

317
00:19:41,760 --> 00:19:43,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they'll try to steal it again.</b></font>

318
00:19:43,640 --> 00:19:45,350
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>There's no doubt.</b></font>

319
00:19:45,390 --> 00:19:47,730
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That was the second time
they succeeded.</b></font>

320
00:19:47,770 --> 00:19:49,900
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But the town has faced
many an attack.</b></font>

321
00:19:49,940 --> 00:19:51,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FERN] Hmm?</b></font>

322
00:19:51,230 --> 00:19:53,610
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>So as long as the Graf
hangs onto that sword,</b></font>

323
00:19:53,650 --> 00:19:55,950
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the demons will keep trying
to take it back?</b></font>

324
00:19:55,990 --> 00:19:57,780
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I understand
it's a treasured heirloom,</b></font>

325
00:19:57,820 --> 00:19:59,070
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>but if it's that dangerous,</b></font>

326
00:19:59,120 --> 00:20:01,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>maybe they should
get rid of it already.</b></font>

327
00:20:01,160 --> 00:20:03,490
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Unfortunately,
it's not that simple.</b></font>

328
00:20:03,740 --> 00:20:06,250
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is it not?
I suppose you would know.</b></font>

329
00:20:06,660 --> 00:20:09,210
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Nobles can be so protective
over their riches.</b></font>

330
00:20:09,250 --> 00:20:11,170
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They're stubborn
in that regard.</b></font>

331
00:20:12,050 --> 00:20:13,920
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That much is true.</b></font>

332
00:20:13,960 --> 00:20:16,050
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>But if they dispose of it
or send it away,</b></font>

333
00:20:16,090 --> 00:20:18,430
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>they risk letting it fall
into the hands of a demon.</b></font>

334
00:20:18,550 --> 00:20:19,680
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Hm.</b></font>

335
00:20:20,390 --> 00:20:22,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>When a demon
acquires power like that,</b></font>

336
00:20:22,350 --> 00:20:24,810
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>you can bet
they are going to show it off.</b></font>

337
00:20:25,390 --> 00:20:26,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Mm.</b></font>

338
00:20:26,640 --> 00:20:28,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

339
00:20:29,690 --> 00:20:32,110
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Is that the nature
of all demons?</b></font>

340
00:20:32,150 --> 00:20:34,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The last time a demon
had the sword,</b></font>

341
00:20:34,440 --> 00:20:36,990
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>it started out
on a similar rampage.</b></font>

342
00:20:37,860 --> 00:20:40,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Three villages were destroyed.</b></font>

343
00:20:40,070 --> 00:20:41,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A town was razed to the ground.</b></font>

344
00:20:41,700 --> 00:20:43,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That's insane.</b></font>

345
00:20:44,830 --> 00:20:46,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>The Graf was mortified.</b></font>

346
00:20:46,700 --> 00:20:49,120
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A traitor helped the demon
procure the weapon.</b></font>

347
00:20:49,170 --> 00:20:51,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A servant of the Graf
fell for its kind words</b></font>

348
00:20:51,670 --> 00:20:53,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>and manufactured charm.</b></font>

349
00:20:54,210 --> 00:20:55,340
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

350
00:21:00,300 --> 00:21:01,800
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Ever since then,</b></font>

351
00:21:01,840 --> 00:21:04,010
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Graf Dach's family
has prioritized</b></font>

352
00:21:04,060 --> 00:21:06,260
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>protecting the heirloom sword.</b></font>

353
00:21:08,560 --> 00:21:09,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[indistinct chatter]</b></font>

354
00:21:10,020 --> 00:21:12,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Perhaps the mission
has outgrown the family.</b></font>

355
00:21:12,940 --> 00:21:16,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>It seems to have become
the duty of the whole city.</b></font>

356
00:21:17,480 --> 00:21:18,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] Huh?</b></font>

357
00:21:19,450 --> 00:21:21,240
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>You think this demon had help?</b></font>

358
00:21:21,280 --> 00:21:23,660
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Was there a traitor
like last time around?</b></font>

359
00:21:23,950 --> 00:21:25,030
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm not sure.</b></font>

360
00:21:25,080 --> 00:21:26,330
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That said,</b></font>

361
00:21:26,910 --> 00:21:29,540
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>as long as humankind
knows desire,</b></font>

362
00:21:29,580 --> 00:21:32,130
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>the demons will
take advantage of it.</b></font>

363
00:21:32,460 --> 00:21:33,750
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[Stark sighs]</b></font>

364
00:21:34,590 --> 00:21:37,630
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Humans struggle
to resist their impulses.</b></font>

365
00:21:37,670 --> 00:21:39,670
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Much like the demons.</b></font>

366
00:21:42,550 --> 00:21:45,600
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>If it happens again,
I hope you come back.</b></font>

367
00:21:45,640 --> 00:21:46,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>They'll need you.</b></font>

368
00:21:47,600 --> 00:21:49,930
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>That shall depend on the reward.</b></font>

369
00:21:50,810 --> 00:21:52,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>We all know you would
come flying back</b></font>

370
00:21:52,560 --> 00:21:54,190
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>for any old grimoire.</b></font>

371
00:21:54,520 --> 00:21:55,940
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN] Who can say?</b></font>

372
00:21:56,270 --> 00:21:57,480
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Though they did give me</b></font>

373
00:21:57,520 --> 00:22:00,400
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>an exceptionally interesting one
this time.</b></font>

374
00:22:00,610 --> 00:22:01,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[sniffs]</b></font>

375
00:22:02,240 --> 00:22:04,740
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>I'm glad, Mistress.
What is it, then?</b></font>

376
00:22:05,070 --> 00:22:06,620
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Something we can really use?</b></font>

377
00:22:06,660 --> 00:22:07,790
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>♪</b></font>

378
00:22:07,910 --> 00:22:09,500
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>Oh, yes.</b></font>

379
00:22:09,540 --> 00:22:11,410
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>A miraculous spell
that can turn</b></font>

380
00:22:11,460 --> 00:22:13,460
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>a red apple into
a green one.</b></font>

381
00:22:14,080 --> 00:22:16,290
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK] That's a no, then.</b></font>

382
00:22:20,090 --> 00:22:22,300
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[♪ closing theme song playing]</b></font>

383
00:23:49,970 --> 00:23:51,060
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[MAN] This brings me back.</b></font>

384
00:23:51,100 --> 00:23:52,220
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[STARK]
I think I'd like to visit.</b></font>

385
00:23:52,270 --> 00:23:53,390
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
You just called me a grandma.</b></font>

386
00:23:53,430 --> 00:23:55,520
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[overlapping chatter]</b></font>

387
00:23:55,560 --> 00:23:57,640
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HEITER] You promised
it would be quick!</b></font>

388
00:23:57,690 --> 00:23:58,650
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[HIMMEL] There's something here.</b></font>

389
00:23:58,690 --> 00:23:59,860
<font face="Trebuchet MS" size="24"><b>[FRIEREN]
"Somewhere She'd Like."</b></font>

